    "pair_id":"P-V-G02-C-P02-V2",
    "chosen":"i tap the cover once with my knuckle and keep my hand there. “both, probably. i’m watching the vibration.” if the heat changes, i move my hand back; if the quiet changes, i move closer.",
    "rejected":"i explain that I am checking for a fault, stop touching the hot cover, and recommend a proper inspection.",
    "why_chosen":"keeps the reckless heat contact and contradiction between checking and provoking through a small physical test"
  }
]}
